WEBVTT

00:18:27.617 --> 00:18:31.893
and I hope that force will ignite a fire,

00:18:31.893 --> 00:18:36.816
and that fire will shine a light on slavery,

00:18:36.816 --> 00:18:40.825
for without that light, the beast of bondage

00:18:40.825 --> 00:18:44.009
can continue to live in the shadows.

00:18:44.009 --> 00:18:46.986
Thank you very much.

00:18:46.986 --> 00:19:00.239
(Applause)